  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Thread lamb, zucchini, bell peppers, onions, and garlic onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice and olive oil. Brush the mixture onto the skewers.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 20-25 minutes, or until the lamb is cooked through.",
